= Examples and Exercises

#ej("Cyclic group", [
  The group $ZZ_n$ under addition modulo $n$ is cyclic. Every subgroup of a
  cyclic group is also cyclic.
])

#ex("A non‑abelian group", [
  Show that the symmetric group $S_3$ is not abelian.
])

#proof[
  $S_3$ consists of permutations of three elements. Compute $(1 2)(1 3) = (1 3 2)$
  but $(1 3)(1 2) = (1 2 3)$. Since $(1 3 2) != (1 2 3)$, the group is non‑abelian.
]

#ex("Subgroup test", [
  Prove that a non‑empty subset $H subset.eq G$ is a subgroup iff $a b^(-1) in H$
  whenever $a,b in H$.
])

